  <title>Principles Before Personalities: an offline reader for the 1939 Big Book</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Principles Before Personalities is an offline reader and study app for the public-domain 1939 first edition of Alcoholics Anonymous (the Big Book, pages 1–164) and its 30 personal stories. Highlight, bookmark, add sticky notes and search. Runs on Mac, Windows, Android and iPhone.">
